ee. I see... Let us battle once more. This time, I'll see through all of your methods.","nextNodeIds":[727310702]},{"nodeId":727310702,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13019,"speakerName":"Grandmaster Hanakado","textMapHash":816665802,"text":"Victory and defeat no longer seem so important... Let's just battle for fun, shall we?","nextNodeIds":[727310703]},{"nodeId":727310703,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13019,"speakerName":"Grandmaster Hanakado","textMapHash":2012586354,"text":"It's rare that I should find such a great opponent. It would be a shame to end our battles so soon, would it not?","nextNodeIds":[727310704]},{"nodeId":727310704,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":3278745866,"text":"Sure! Bring it on!","nextNodeIds":[727310705]},{"nodeId":727310705,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":556118874,"text":"But seeing through my secret beetle-fighting techniques? Nah, little fella, that ain't gonna happen!","nextNodeIds":[727310706]},{"nodeId":727310706,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1044,"speakerName":"Arataki Itto","textMapHash":4284354754,"text":"If you'll admit that I'm the stronger beetle fighter, I'll fight you for as many rounds as you want!","nextNodeIds":[727310707]},{"nodeId":727310707,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3777665890,"text":"Huh, looks like Bull-Chucker and Grandmaster Hanakado are still raring to go... Well, let's leave them to it! They can battle beetles till the beetle-battling's done!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7273107,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"